# Temporary P0 override for the Android 16 BPF loader.
#
# Fujisan's 4.4 kernel cannot meet the platform's Android 16 (4.19+) eBPF
# requirement.  netbpfload.rc first defines bpfloader as updatable; this
# later system-init fragment replaces it with a successful no-op and
# deliberately omits "updatable".  The Tethering APEX is consequently unable
# to replace it, so init can continue to the minimal userspace.  This must be
# removed when the kernel is brought up to the required BPF interface level.
service bpfloader /system/bin/true
    override
    user root
    oneshot
